  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n36 - 10 × [ 3 + 8 × { 18 - 6 ( 6 - 5 ) × 3 } ÷ 36 ]\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nParentheses → Brackets → Order of Operations (BODMAS)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 36 - 10 × [ 3 + 8 × { 18 - 6 × ( 1 ) × 3 } ÷ 36 ]\n\n⇒ 36 - 10 × [ 3 + 8 × { 18 - 18 } ÷ 36 ]\n\n⇒ 36 - 10 × [ 3 + 8 × 0 ÷ 36 ]\n\n⇒ 36 - 10 × [ 3 + 0 ]\n\n⇒ 36 - 10 × 3\n\n⇒ 36 - 30\n\n⇒ 6\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 6.**",
